<title>USA: CBOE to list LEAPS on Dean Witter, VeriFone.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list LEAPS on Dean Witter, VeriFone.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said Monday it would list LEAPS (long-term equity anticipation securities) on Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co and VeriFone Inc on March 5.</p>
<p>The exchange said the Dean Witter LEAPS would have strike prices of 30, 40 and 50, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>VeriFone LEAPS would open with strikes of 30, 35 and 40, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
